# Jolene, Plundering Pugilist: "attack with one or more creatures with power 4 or greater" (CR 508.1m, 603.2) is about the
# attackers, not about Jolene attacking: Alpine Grizzly (4/2) and Leopard-Spotted Jiao (3/1) attack together on turn 3 while
# Jolene, cast that turn, stays home, and one Treasure is made (one trigger for the declaration, not one per creature, and
# the 3-power attacker adds none). Bot2 takes 7 (13).

